  "idea": "Async peer recognition bot that rewards teammates in public Slack channels",
  "text": "Celebrate everyday team achievements publicly across your distributed organization on complete autopilot. Fast-paced remote companies frequently rush into next sprint goals without acknowledging the hard work behind recent launches. Neglecting small wins drains team energy, leading to developer fatigue and cynical attitudes during project retrospectives. Deploying HeyTaco leaderboards inside dedicated celebration channels automates shoutouts and highlights top team helpers every Friday. You maintain vibrant team momentum without managerial stress.",
